044	ACT	023	015	Ie amy zao, ry amo Sinedrionaio, Ehe mihalalia amy talèy ty hanjotsoañe aze ama’ areo mintse hamoto­potorañe aze, fa veka’e hanjevoñ’ aze zahay aolo’ t’ie mitotoke.
044	ACT	023	016	Fe tsinano’ ty ana-drahavave’ i Paoly i famandroñañey le nimb’eo nizilik’ añ’anjomba’ o lahin-defoñeo nitalily amy Paoly.
